  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spirit guides your blows</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ki Touch<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can spend 1 point from your ki pool to use this feat as part of any single attack, regardless of the type of action it uses, including an attack of opportunity, charge attack, Vital Strike, or an attack made as a swift or immediate action. It does not require a separate action to activate this feat, and you can use this feat multiple times per round by spending 1 point from your ki pool for each attack you wish to resolve as a touch attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc202\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
